{"parse": {"title": "FT-21", "pageid": 55375, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-20\" title=\"FT-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-21</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-22\" title=\"FT-22\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">21</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.B1.E9.B8.AD.E5.AD.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"旱鸭子\">旱鸭子</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 旱鸭子</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Landlubber</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>脚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>迈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>眼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>看<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>遥<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>边<span class=\"color-value\"></span>际<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010121</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>呜哇……！头儿，圣洛夫基金会到底有什么好的？！你明明知道那里都是一帮扯谎的混球……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>那群高高在上的家伙嘴里从没有半句实话，总是欺骗咱们这样的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>而且……而且，餐馆要是交给了莱格斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抓扯着J的衣服，不愿意松手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅱ：</div><div>放尊重点儿，小鬼！如果不是我们及时赶到，你亲爱的头儿就要被插成马蜂窝了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J蹲坐下来，将双手搭在孩子的肩膀上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>把鼻涕抹干净，小子……我向你打包票，莱格斯还算个不错的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>他会替我，帮你们把乌七八糟的海特街重新收拾起来……到时候，救济所的人会为你们找所学校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>还有……霍利克的摩托车，以后就是你的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都陷入了静默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>唔……那你呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我打算跳进海里，张开手……游一趟试试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>唔，那是什么意思？头儿，你不是……旱鸭子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旁边的床铺，露出了另一个熟悉的面孔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-625611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-625611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-625611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>吵死了！混小子，你又在搞什么？让我安心睡会儿觉不行吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-626014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-626014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-626014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>最该闭嘴的是你，你这条呼噜能响破灯泡的野猪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个打着石膏的男人，额头互相顶撞着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚！”由莱格斯送的花束，被打翻在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">护士：</div><div>闭嘴！你们要是再在病房叫嚣，我保证给你们打上一剂麻醉药，插上尿管和呼吸机，让你们老老实实睡到下个月！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们灰溜溜地钻回了被窝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J向另一位职员伸出了手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>这次我欠你个人情，“剃刀”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>不，这是那名梅克卢女士的功劳，要不是她为我们指路，打开那扇门……我们也没法及时赶到，一起制止那名神秘的少女。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>到最后……环状水星还是绕过所有人，走在了前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>她总是这样让自己陷进去，将自己的命运置之度外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>一步步自毁，最后像一位殉道者让自己遍体鳞伤……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>你们得向我保证，把她带回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>可惜的是，由于事发突然，我们没能做好充足的准备将那名少女截留下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……别丧气，你们好歹还截留下了我这条命，不是吗？因此赚到了整条海特街最值钱的人情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>对了，那个小家伙，玛蒂尔达去哪儿了？她今天不是应该来接我加入圣洛夫基金会吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他欲言又止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅱ：</div><div>她已经被紧急传唤回去了，估计还要搞几份调查报告吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅱ：</div><div>不过，这次的事情可不好收场啊。涉及太多普通民众了，而且她没有按照计划行事，也差点丢失了与我们的联系……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅱ：</div><div>往最坏的可能去联想，她一直引以为傲的职级可就要保不住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>什么？她可是解决这次事件最大的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一双手再次将他拦住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>J……这是他们的规矩，如果你确认加入他们，那你也得接受这样的规矩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>她现在在哪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>我们无权知晓……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-304110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-304110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-304110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>啊嚏！我的鼻子……真奇怪，这可还没到换季的时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>你还好吗？玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>临时委派任务的上司，正站在眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>不，没事……请您继续！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>我昨晚读了你的调查报告……我必须说，你的献身为我们取得了相当重要的情报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>根据你的报告，那批失踪的资产包括最重要的“封藏品”，经由温妮弗雷德，最终落到了重塑之手的手上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>所幸，那名重塑之手成员，是他们渺不足道的众多“信徒”之一，他对那名神秘少女的控制暂且有限……这对我们来说，至少是一个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>你让圣洛夫基金会的那些高层，都记住了你的名字，玛蒂尔达小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖，伯纳德先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>对了，趁着这次任务结束的休假……我还想向您提出一项申请……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我希望能去妈妈的安全屋一趟，确认她的安危……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>——在与那位名叫温妮弗雷德的商人以及那群商贩接触时，他们都多次提及了我的妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>在休假的这段时间里……我希望能去看看她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>当然，把申请书留在这里，我会为你安排的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>谢谢您，伯纳德先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她就要兴奋地迈开脚步——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>等等……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将女孩的兴奋按捺了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>有人嘱托我，说你把这件东西给忘在了旧金山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>奇怪……我应该没有忘记任何东西啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伯纳德拉开抽屉，将东西交到她的手掌心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-508501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伯纳德：</div><div>他说，这是你的升职证明。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呃，您的意思是——您没有把我收回去的打算？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那么——我、我是否可以自己去找吃的？不论是什么都可以？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"410401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"410401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻守的信徒：</div><div>ㄞˋ——！杀……杀死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回应她的只有前言不搭后语的句子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不，我是说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她忽然意识到了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……能请您稍稍坐下来一会儿吗？请放心，您只需要回答“是”与“否”就好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"410401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"410401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻守的信徒：</div><div>ㄞˋ——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>是，或否？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"410401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"410401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻守的信徒：</div><div>ㄞˋ——杀死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信徒如同一只高傲的野鹅，挥舞着锤子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从森林一侧，跑到另一侧，东奔又西跑——乐此不疲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……好的，好的！太好了，我明白您的需要了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼神逐渐亮起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不需要正常的回应，在那愣头愣脑的回答里，她终于嗅到了从门缝溜进来的自由的气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>遵循您的意见，您想让谁去死，都由您说了算！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我们可以先找找下一个目的地，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"410401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"410401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻守的信徒：</div><div>ㄞˋ——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>明白了，明白了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她殷勤地点头，荒谬地回答着这些胡言乱语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她明白，这将是她前所未有的一次新生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我们这就出发，去您想去的地方！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"410401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"410401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-410401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-410401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻守的信徒：</div><div>ㄞ——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿起树枝，自顾自地当作缰绳牵引着信徒，去往他的“想去的地方”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>余光时不时回望，试图在他身上寻见玩具的所在……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-21"}}